UID:VUDcsmrY4m
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club A rugged loner (R
 oddy Piper) stumbles upon a terrifying discovery: ghoulish creatures are m
 asquerading as humans while they lull the public into submission through s
 ubliminal advertising messages.  Introduced by SIFF Cinema Assistant Mana
 ger Tony Ochoa.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-clu
 b/they-live
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
